(Page 2. Maintenance and retention) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Planned maintenance happens every Sunday between 02:00 and 03:00 UTC.) Tj T*
(Inbound addresses keep accepting webhooks during maintenance, and) Tj T*
(deliveries resume when the window ends.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Delivery logs are kept for 14 days on every plan. Payload bodies are) Tj T*
(kept for 3 days and then deleted, even when the delivery failed.) Tj T*
ET
