(Page 3. Incident response) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Incidents have three severities. A SEV1 incident stops deliveries for) Tj T*
(more than one workspace; the on-call engineer responds within 15) Tj T*
(minutes. A SEV2 incident delays deliveries; the response target is) Tj T*
(1 hour. A SEV3 incident affects a single feature; the response target) Tj T*
(is one business day. Status updates are posted at) Tj T*
(status.fernwick.example every 30 minutes during a SEV1 incident.) Tj T*
